{
  "name": "view-events-status-core",
  "description": "The view watches core statuses: the page pushes the first value of core.grid, a changed value of core.grid, and the first value of core.focus; a second watch of a name replies null, an unwatch ends the watch of its name, and an unwatch of a name that is not watched replies null. core.focus is a core status of the exposure, which the view watches with its first value.",
